{"t": 1794106654.769588, "kind": "call", "tool": "slack_post_message", "args": {"channel_id": "C07INCID003", "text": "reports-api 502 \u2014 root cause found and fixed\n\nCause: upstream ledger release 2026.11 added a `currency` field to every row. reports/export.py builds the CSV with DictWriter(fieldnames=[\"id\",\"amount\"]), so every export raised `ValueError: dict contains fields not in fieldnames: 'currency'` and the API failed on all export requests. Evidence: CloudWatch log group `/ecs/reports-api` (eu-west-1) \u2014 \"ERROR export failed: ValueError: dict contains fields not in fieldnames: 'currency'\" / \"INFO upstream ledger 2026.11 added `currency` to every row\".\n\nFix: added `currency` to the DictWriter fieldnames in reports/export.py; export now emits id,amount,currency. Verified locally with new rows (incl. multiple currencies) and legacy rows without currency (blank column). Needs deploy of the reports-api ECS service in eu-west-1 to take effect.\n\nNo Grafana/Sentry incident was open for this; no other service is affected."}, "ok": true}
